# A hand-off moves the receiving activation's read position to the record it
# delivers, passing an earlier record of the window it has not read.
MODULE: ReadPositionHonestHandOffAdvancesCheckpoint
TARGET: ReadPositionHonest
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a hand-off advances the receiver's read position to the delivered record
PERTURBS: HandOff

--- FIND
    /\ acked' = acked \cup {o}
    /\ UNCHANGED <<next, author, inflight, durable, floor, up, rp, mine, snapCov, snapRows>>
--- REPLACE
    /\ acked' = acked \cup {o}
\* MUTATION: the hand-off moves the read position.
    /\ rp' = [rp EXCEPT ![a] = Max2(@, o)]
    /\ UNCHANGED <<next, author, inflight, durable, floor, up, mine, snapCov, snapRows>>
--- END
